{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kung Fu Addiction, turns are not about waiting for your opponent. Both you and your enemy plan attacks and defenses at the same time. You can see enemy intentions, including powerful special techniques, and must decide whether to counter, defend, or commit to your own strategy. Once choices are locked in, the turn unfolds as a fast sequence of simultaneous actions where anticipation and smart decisions decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/a7d1b3b9815bfd69e556266e9b970aab.poster.avif?t=1772014553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/a7d1b3b9815bfd69e556266e9b970aab.webm?t=1772014553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/a7d1b3b9815bfd69e556266e9b970aab.mp4?t=1772014553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR HERO\u2019S SKILLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your fighter and customize their physical appearance, then define their combat style through a flexible skill tree. Choose a high-damage, defensive, or balanced approach and build a warrior that fits your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/4a124347ce08c763688a086d05154b49.poster.avif?t=1772014553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/4a124347ce08c763688a086d05154b49.webm?t=1772014553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/4a124347ce08c763688a086d05154b49.mp4?t=1772014553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE MULTIPLE THREATS ACROSS DIFFERENT COMBAT MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two battles feel the same. Different enemies and rule variations push you to rethink your approach, adjust your skill choices, and anticipate new attack patterns as difficulty escalates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/5aca790a423b085629513e9d7471bc9a.poster.avif?t=1772014553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/5aca790a423b085629513e9d7471bc9a.webm?t=1772014553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/5aca790a423b085629513e9d7471bc9a.mp4?t=1772014553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based auto-battler system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipation-driven gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero progression paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill unlocks &amp; upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple combat modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating difficulty</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620860?t=1772014553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/1ce97779c06af41d2d1bb26c5701401fd2272bec/page_bg_raw.jpg?