eir physical appearance, then define their combat style through a flexible skill tree. Choose a high-damage, defensive, or balanced approach and build a warrior that fits your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/4a124347ce08c763688a086d05154b49.poster.avif?t=1772014553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/4a124347ce08c763688a086d05154b49.webm?t=1772014553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/4a124347ce08c763688a086d05154b49.mp4?t=1772014553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE MULTIPLE THREATS ACROSS DIFFERENT COMBAT MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two battles feel the same. Different enemies and rule variations push you to rethink your approach, adjust your skill choices, and anticipate new attack patterns as difficulty escalates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/5aca790a423b085629513e9d7471bc9a.poster.avif?t=1772014553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/5aca790a423b085629513e9d7471bc9a.webm?t=1772014553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/5aca790a423b085629513e9d7471bc9a.mp4?t=1772014553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><